<title>USA: Control Data targets electronic commerce.</title>
<headline>Control Data targets electronic commerce.</headline>
<dateline>ARDEN HILLS, Minn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Control Data Systems Inc said Thursday it will invest in 1997 in its electronic commerce business and is strengthening its sales and marketing programs.</p>
<p>&quot;We are committed to making incremental investments during 1997 in our electronic commerce business,&quot; Jim Ousley, president and chief executive, said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;(W)e are strengthening our sales and marketing programs. We strongly believe these investments are in the best interest of the company's constituents,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
